# Default-deny build context: only what the image build needs reaches the daemon.
# This excludes .git, .githooks, .cache (venv, uv/mypy/colima state), tests, scripts,
# scratchpads, IDE configs, virtualenvs, .env files and other local credentials.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
# Required by the package metadata (pyproject `readme`); the only markdown let through.
!README.md
!src

# Never ship interpreter or OS litter from src/.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
